# Meta Model API key for Muse Voice Transcribe (create one in the Model API dashboard at https://dev.meta.ai).
# Server-side only: never prefix with VITE_ and never commit the real value.
# Local dev:  MODEL_API_KEY=your-key npm run dev
# Deployed:   add MODEL_API_KEY as a secret in your host (e.g. Lovable project secrets).
MODEL_API_KEY=
# Optional, defaults to muse-voice-transcribe-1.0
ASR_MODEL=muse-voice-transcribe-1.0
